  "description": "Official SDK for consuming the TAF background job executor (scheduler) service.\n      Provides ISchedulerClient for creating recurring and one-time jobs, and ships the\n      JobFiredEvent contract that consuming services bind to. Consumers MUST bind to the\n      shipped contract type — MassTransit derives its exchange from the message's\n      namespace-qualified URN, so a locally declared look-alike binds elsewhere and\n      silently receives nothing.",
